{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>SANTAQUEST</i>, the North Pole isn\u2019t all jolly cheer\u2014it\u2019s a battlefield of frosty foes and festive fury! Step into Santa\u2019s boots and journey through icy zones packed with Christmas-themed enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat holiday baddies in side-by-side combat, earn powerful color-tiered gear, and upgrade your suit, stats, and skills to take on even stronger adversaries. Each region offers new challenges, from forest elves to corrupted snowman, all wrapped in a vibrant, wintery atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind. Gift. Glory. Only <i>you</i>,  Santa, can restore peace to Christmas and prove who truly runs the North Pole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Santa with stats and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-by-side combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-tiered gear and loot progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowy, Christmas-themed environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple regions and enemy types to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy yet chaotic holiday soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh seasonal adventure from <strong>NecroCatic Games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom OST Soundtrack by Murd3rcat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn enemies by Cesare from Italy</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4166750?t=1765872126","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166750/35b95df8af20f5c28c19b094a946ce8dcb93f853/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765872126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166750/f7e8531fa15646e23c01734b26a3d9ffe7e79d72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765872126","c